{"version":1,"content":"<p>晶片設計公司Arm Holdings行政總裁雷內·哈斯（Rene Haas）此前曾被接洽，作為英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳的潛在繼任者。如今，哈斯已延長合同，將繼續領導Arm直至2033年。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587662.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:03:50.775309+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:49:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:12.497522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:57:12.497522+00:00","content_hash":"cc1539c7b677ae5a8696c0c9288cd17c4b38ed65cdcde4e19be427210ffd793d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}